{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","辉光圆阵"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","画出法阵，禁止其中的敌人恢复生命值并对其造成真实伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","消耗250 − 10点能量，以当前目标为中心画出半径1格的法阵，形成时对区域内敌人造成210% + 20% ATK真实伤害。法阵存在期间，自身每秒消耗120点能量，法阵内所有敌人无法回复生命，每0.5秒受到35% ATK加上目标已损失生命值20%的真实伤害。额外伤害部分不超过自身攻击力的240%。若持续1秒内法阵中无敌人，本技能会提前结束。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":10,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":47,"end":53,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":43,"end":57,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":103,"end":110,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","法阵形成时伤害提升至220% + 20% ATK，后续的持续伤害提升至40% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":35,"end":42,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","法阵形成时伤害提升至230% + 20% ATK，后续的持续伤害提升至45% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":35,"end":42,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","法阵形成时伤害提升至240% + 20% ATK，后续的持续伤害提升至50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":35,"end":42,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","法阵形成时伤害提升至250% + 20% ATK，后续的持续伤害提升至55% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":35,"end":42,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","圣佑之刃"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","使用十字剑祈祷，使自身获得护盾并对敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","将十字剑放在胸前祈祷，自身获得可抵御200% + 20% ATK伤害的护盾，持续6秒，并为剑附上圣洁的力量，对目标造成250% + 25% ATK伤害。若释放该技能时，自身带有友军施加的非永久属性提升效果，伤害类型变为真实伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":28,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":63,"end":69,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":32,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":59,"end":73,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","对目标造成的伤害提升至260% + 25% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","对目标造成的伤害提升至270% + 25% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","对目标造成的伤害提升至280% + 25% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","约誓圣言"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","使用符器庇护自身和一名友军，获得攻击力提升和对周围一格的眩晕效果。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","备战时，选择1格范围内的一名友方英雄缔约圣言（优先选择更靠近身后的友军）。主动释放时，为自身和该英雄提升12% + 1.5%攻击力，持续10秒，持续时间结束后会再次释放此效果。在持续时间内，每3秒对增益持有者1格范围内的敌人造成0.5秒眩晕和100% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":55,"end":62,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":121,"end":129,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","为自身和友军提升的攻击力提升至13% + 1.5%。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":25,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","为自身和友军提升的攻击力提升至14% + 1.5%。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":25,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","为自身和友军提升的攻击力提升至15% + 1.5%。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":25,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高12点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高16点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高20点急速。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","邪灵挽歌"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","法阵存在时，自身获得增强，法阵内敌人受到额外的真实伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","当法阵存在时，使用“圣佑之刃”替换普攻，获得的护盾值不超过600% ATK。每次友军对法阵内敌人造成伤害时，将附带友军攻击力75%的真实伤害，每名友军1秒内最多触发1次附加伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":29,"end":37,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","附带的真实伤害提升至友军攻击力的80%。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每场战斗一次，法阵内敌人被击败时，使自身获得10%的攻击力，并使法阵永久强化，半径扩大到2格。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","附带的真实伤害提升至友军攻击力的85%。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","降低法阵内敌人复活后的受愈。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","若法阵内的敌人在生命值归零后再次复活，则使其受愈下降50点。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","誓言之心"]]}